  "content": "<p>此模組是為&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crackers-wither-storm-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cracker 的凋靈風暴模組</a> 和&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-mod-for-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">終界鋼模組</a> 所添加的。</p>\n<p>這是我的第一個專案。</p>\n<p>我擁有 Discord 帳號。</p>\n<p>加入 Discord <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5BWTwGf8Rt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a></p>\n<p>我並沒有複製「Cracker 的凋靈風暴模組」。</p>\n<p>新增爆炸方塊、武器、新物品、合成配方、新陷阱。</p>\n<p>我是單獨開發，但我不與 \"nonamecrackers2\" 合作。</p>\n<p>合成教學圖片：抱歉，我無法上傳圖片。</p>\n<p>合成教學下載：在「附加檔案」中，還有預告片影片以及&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a>。</p>\n<p>請大家按照我在創造模式物品欄標籤頁中的爆炸方塊數量操作（已經有合成配方的爆炸方塊除外），然後將它們全部丟棄（除了必須使用鑽石鎬採挖的4個硬方塊，以及在 Minecraft 中最硬的2個方塊必須使用 formidibomb 之外），放入 TNT 鍛造台（1.19.4 V2, 1.19.2 V3, 1.18.2 V2）。</p>\n<p>我刪除了 TNT 鍛造台和指令方塊鍛造台。</p>\n<p>獲取爆炸方塊？按下鍵盤上的按鈕（舊版）：</p>\n<p>N：自然</p>\n<p>B：建築</p>\n<p>M：礦物</p>\n<p>O：無爆炸</p>\n<p>K：功能性</p>\n<p>P：木材和木板</p>\n<p>G：下界</p>\n<p>I：終界</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6>如何讓我的模組正常運作的說明：</h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dH7X925eUaM?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/B2r6_qjKs1Y?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wMmYbpxfsAs?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>影片更新：</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:640px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/j4uHtpjXQcc?si=1Wsish6Ue6ML-kt2\" width=\"640\" height=\"377\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ohC7vOVWi-A?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>在我的網站下載&nbsp;<a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/experiments-2010/home\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a></p>\n<p>Modrinth&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexplosive-block-crackers-wither-storm-mod-and-enderite-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a></p>\n<p>MediaFire&nbsp;<span class=\"link-removed\"> 連結已移除： <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.mediafire.com%2ffolder%2f8o7fggzm80ppn%2fMy_mods\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.mediafire.com/folder/8o7fggzm80ppn/My_mods</a> </span></p>\n<p>GitHub&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/SuperHero2010/Explosive-Block-Cracker-s-Wither-Storm-Mod-and-Enderite-Mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a></p>\n<p>MCreator (新連結)&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcreator.net%252fmodification%252f106311%252fexplosive-block-crackers-wither-storm-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a></p>\n<p>MCreator&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcreator.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a></p>\n<p>MCreator 連結&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcreator.net%252fdownload%252flink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a></p>\n<p>YouTube 頻道：<a href=\"https://youtube.com/@SuperHero20102\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtube.com/@SuperHero20102</a></p>\n<p>原版：<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explosive-block-original\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explosive-block-original</a></p>\n<p>預告片（原版）：</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Pa8ie5pgmGA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>GeckoLib&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a></p>",
